{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"5215194de5c957a9","name":"card_unit_sexton","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Britain/Base/units/card_unit_sexton","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SEXTON","text":"Deployment: Pin an enemy unit. At the start of your turn, pin that unit again.","flavorText":"The 25pdr SP, tracked, Sexton was a Canadian built self-propelled artillery vehicle used by the British and other Allied forces in WWII. Two variants were made, the Sexton I with its design based on the Canadian Ram tank hull and the chassis of the American Medium Tank M3, and then the Sexton II design which was based on the Grizzly (M4A1 Sherman) hull. Both versions used a QF 25 pounder gun-howitzer as its main armament and for secondary armament it used two 0.303 (7.7 mm) Bren light machine guns.The British forces used the Sexton for indirect supporting fire and kept them back from the front line and used forward observers to direct fire onto a target. The Sexton was produced from 1943 to 1945 with a total of 2000 units put into service.","faction":"Britain","type":"artillery","rarity":"Unique","cost":5,"operationCost":2,"attack":3,"defense":4},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_sexton","title":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_sexton_title","SourceString":"SEXTON","LocalizedString":"SEXTON"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::artillery","attack":3,"defense":4,"range":2,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Britain","kredits":5,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_sexton_text","SourceString":"Deployment: Pin an enemy unit. At the start of your turn, pin that unit again.","LocalizedString":"Deployment: Pin an enemy unit. At the start of your turn, pin that unit again."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_britain","Key":"card_unit_sexton_history","SourceString":"The 25pdr SP, tracked, Sexton was a Canadian built self-propelled artillery vehicle used by the British and other Allied forces in WWII. Two variants were made, the Sexton I with its design based on the Canadian Ram tank hull and the chassis of the American Medium Tank M3, and then the Sexton II design which was based on the Grizzly (M4A1 Sherman) hull. Both versions used a QF 25 pounder gun-howitzer as its main armament and for secondary armament it used two 0.303 (7.7 mm) Bren light machine guns.The British forces used the Sexton for indirect supporting fire and kept them back from the front line and used forward observers to direct fire onto a target. The Sexton was produced from 1943 to 1945 with a total of 2000 units put into service.","LocalizedString":"The 25pdr SP, tracked, Sexton was a Canadian built self-propelled artillery vehicle used by the British and other Allied forces in WWII. Two variants were made, the Sexton I with its design based on the Canadian Ram tank hull and the chassis of the American Medium Tank M3, and then the Sexton II design which was based on the Grizzly (M4A1 Sherman) hull. Both versions used a QF 25 pounder gun-howitzer as its main armament and for secondary armament it used two 0.303 (7.7 mm) Bren light machine guns.The British forces used the Sexton for indirect supporting fire and kept them back from the front line and used forward observers to direct fire onto a target. The Sexton was produced from 1943 to 1945 with a total of 2000 units put into service."},"operationCost":2,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Basic","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardLeaveBoardOrOwner","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Deployment","EHelpBubbleTypes::Pin","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger"],"hasDeployment":true,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Light_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Units/Tank_Light_Move_Fx.0"},"soundMoveToFrontline":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Tank_Light_Move_Fx'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Asset